msgstr "Dürfen wir fragen, warum du gegangen bist?"

#: lib/Automation/Integrations/MailPoetPremium/Templates/PremiumTemplatesFactory.php:684
msgid "Reach out to subscribers who canceled and ask for their feedback to help improve your service."
